    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d103">

                <pb facs="0134" n="124" sameAs="frus:frus1943China/pg124"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 Pacific War/3440: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Atcheson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-09-18T00:00:00-04:00">September 18,
                            1943—midnight</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1315. Embassy’s 1711, September 15, 9 a.m. Reference final paragraph.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Present expectation is to send congratulatory message upon Generalissimo
                        Chiang Kai-shek’s formal inauguration,<anchor n="50" xml:id="d103-f1"/> date
                        of which, according to the Chinese Embassy, is to be fixed later.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Further consideration will be given to despatch of message suggested in
                        Embassy’s 1674, September 11, upon receipt of the Ambassador’s <pb
                            facs="0135" n="125" xml:id="pg125"/> views and an indication of the
                        Generalissimo’s reaction to any informal approach the Ambassador may decide
                        to make on this subject.</item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d103-f1" n="50" xml:id="d103-f1-content">
                <p>As President of the National Government of the Republic of China; see note from
                    the Chinese Ambassador, September 15, <ref target="#pg339">p. 339</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
